+-- brow rim with a length of bone inlaid off centre, cheek guards and a nasal
+-- framing a bronze lower-face plate that leaves only the eyes bare, a
+-- mould-black leather curtain at the nape, and moss grown into the crown.
+-- Rounded and masked, its own shape beside the iron kettle and the studded cap.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+local c = Kit.colors
+
+local bronze = { 112, 96, 62 }
+local bronzeWorn = { 156, 134, 94 }
+local moss = { 76, 96, 60 }
